          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read the complete text and individually inspected the matching image for Larson–Partida physical pages 1–2. Confirmed exact v1 date, authors and nineteen-page primary. The intro begins with actual globally generated toric bundles, dual universal subspaces and the matroid normal-fan chart coefficient convention, then extends the coefficient classes to arbitrary matroids. Equivariant elementary symmetric roots correspond to the universal subbundle/dual of the original generated E, so Chern-flow's later dual-matroid and sign calibration must be retained. The real graded PD/HL/HR package and projective simplicial fan assumptions are explicit; no representability is imposed on the combinatorial input. This is the start of a full-paper proof reading, with the multiple-bundle theorem still to be checked."
