          "note": "Read complete KM physical pages 17 and 19 and individually displayed the matching sheet. Defs. 4.5–4.9 describe upper filtration flats, apartment diagrams, parliament polyhedra with upper inequalities, presentation-dependent tropicalization, and the rank/miminality conditions on DJS presentations; the Fano example is an attributed source example, not a fresh computation. Lemma 5.1 gives the complete single-basis-exchange proof that continuous symmetric functions of apartment weights glue: an optimal basis exchange forces equality of the exchanged weights through its fundamental circuit. Definition 5.2 uses exponential characters in the localized equivariant K-theory ring; this does not establish an exact category of tropical bundles. Page 18 was not selected or credited. The flag-order issue in Proposition 3.7 remains pending the unselected Definition 3.2."
