          "note": "Read complete KM physical page 25 and individually displayed the matching image. Proposition 6.9 restricts recovery of ordinary sections and Euler characteristics to extensions of DJS presentations. Theorem 6.10 states asymptotic equality of the rank-defined Euler characteristic with the global-section rank and integral polynomial growth under high ample twists; its proof continues on unselected pages, so this checkpoint does not certify that proof. Lemma 6.11 begins an inclusion-exclusion argument over matroid flats, also continued beyond the selection. No status claim about the historical global-sections question is made. This completes the declared initial 17-page KM selection; Definition 3.2 on pages 13–14 will be read separately to resolve the basis/flag ordering convention."
