          "note": "Read complete Ardila physical pages 1–2 and individually displayed the matching image. Verified math/0404370v1 dated 20 April 2004, author and scope. Ardila's Bergman fan requires every element to belong to a minimum-weight basis; this is the opposite sign of KM's minimum-on-circuits/maximum-basis convention. His subdominant ultrametric is the componentwise greatest minorant, whereas the Chern-flow closure envelope is a least majorant after sign reversal. Do not combine these formulas without that reversal."
