          "matching_sheet_image_individually_displayed": true,
          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read complete Huh Milnor physical pages 1–2 and individually displayed the matching image. Verified June Huh, arXiv 1008.4749v3 dated 10 February 2012, title and historical representable characteristic-zero log-concavity context. These introductory historical conjectures are not current open statuses. The selected role here is the ordered-simplex mixed-volume calculation underlying Chern flow's quartic apolar counterexample; it is distinct from Huh's 2026 Schubert differential-covolume paper already read at the earlier checkpoint."
        },
        {
          "UTC": "2026-10-07T21:34:24.333565+00:00",
