          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read complete Huh Milnor physical pages 15–16 and individually displayed the matching image. Read the selected Okounkov-body/Brunn–Minkowski proof of the nef mixed-intersection inequality with its explicitly cited Bertini/Kleiman inputs, the no-internal-zero closure argument, and the exceptional representability cases. These contextual arguments do not replace the book's existing all-field geometric volume convention or license an arbitrary irreducible realization. The ordered-simplex formula needed for the quartic counterexample begins on the next selected page."
        },
        {
          "UTC": "2026-10-07T21:34:39.887226+00:00",
