          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read complete Huh Milnor physical pages 17–18 and individually displayed the matching image. Lemma 36 states the ordered-simplex mixed-volume formula lambda_1 ... lambda_i, with decreasing positive lambda, and explicitly attributes the computation to Shephard pp. 134–136 without reproducing its proof. Thus the quartic's toric realization uses a precisely located classical formula; no independent proof of Shephard is claimed. Read the subsequent representability construction with its multiple and exceptional-case restrictions; do not assert every log-concave array is itself represented by an irreducible variety. Completed all six selected Huh pages and all 47 initial dependency sheets, each with complete text and an individually displayed matching image."
        }
